<div class="lab-panel" id="panel-quant" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-quant" hidden><div class="lab-visual"><svg data-lab-svg="quant" viewBox="0 0 560 300" role="img" aria-label="量化示意：连续曲线与有限等级的离散近似对比。"></svg><div class="lab-visual-footer"><div class="plot-legend"><span>CONTINUOUS</span><span>QUANTIZED</span></div></div></div><div class="lab-copy"><span class="eyebrow">LESS, BUT MEANINGFUL</span><h3>更紧凑的表示，<br>更清晰的取舍。</h3><p class="lab-description">用有限的等级近似连续数值。调整位数，观察曲线如何变化，理解表示精度与离散误差之间的关系。</p><div class="lab-steps"><b>连续数值</b><i>→</i><span>离散映射</span><i>→</i><span>近似表示</span></div><div class="lab-controls"><label for="bits-range">表示位数</label><input id="bits-range" data-bits-range type="range" min="1" max="6" value="3"/><output data-bits-output for="bits-range">3 bit</output></div><p class="lab-feedback" data-quant-feedback aria-live="polite">8 个表示等级</p></div></div>
<div class="lab-panel" id="panel-agent" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-agent" hidden><div class="lab-visual"><svg data-lab-svg="agent" viewBox="0 0 560 300" role="img" aria-label="Agent 概念闭环：理解任务、规划、执行工具、验证与交付；关键操作需要人类确认。"></svg><div class="lab-visual-footer"><div class="plot-legend"><span>WORKFLOW</span><span>ACTIVE STEP</span></div><span>HUMAN OVERSIGHT BY DESIGN</span></div></div><div class="lab-copy"><span class="eyebrow">FROM INTENT TO ACTION</span><h3>让一次意图，<br>成为可检查的行动。</h3><p class="lab-description">理解任务、制定计划、调用工具，再检查结果。逐步查看 Agent 工作流程，了解任务如何推进，以及人在关键节点如何参与。</p><div class="lab-steps"><b data-agent-stage>理解任务</b><i>→</i><span>执行与验证</span><i>→</i><span>交付</span></div><div class="lab-controls"><button class="button" data-agent-step>下一步 →</button><button class="button button-quiet" data-agent-reset>重置 ↺</button></div><p class="lab-feedback" data-agent-feedback aria-live="polite">点击“下一步”，查看各阶段的任务与衔接。</p></div></div></div>
